WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.049
One protein name conceals two biological situations.

00:00:04.049 --> 00:00:08.676
ACE2 attached to a membrane is not interchangeable with

00:00:08.676 --> 00:00:10.219
circulating soluble ACE2.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.845
ACE2 can be embedded in a cell membrane or exist in a

00:00:19.845 --> 00:00:23.142
soluble form. They should not be discussed as identical

00:00:23.142 --> 00:00:23.875
biological objects.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:37.022
ACE2 participates in the renin-angiotensin system. In

00:00:37.022 --> 00:00:40.288
SARS-CoV-2 infection, its receptor-related role

00:00:40.288 --> 00:00:42.901
introduces additional biological complexity.

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:51.397
The review examines how changes in membrane-bound and

00:00:51.397 --> 00:00:54.357
soluble ACE2 expression might influence interpretations

00:00:54.357 --> 00:00:56.823
of viral biology and complications.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:06.113
A measured protein change does not, without suitable

00:01:06.113 --> 00:01:08.860
functional evidence, settle viral infectivity or

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:09.775
clinical outcomes.

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:20.790
The two forms occupy different physical contexts and

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:23.295
have different interpretive problems, especially in

00:01:23.295 --> 00:01:25.801
discussions of viral entry and inflammation.

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:36.355
The 2021 review weighs emerging research at a rapidly

00:01:36.355 --> 00:01:40.260
changing moment. The date of evidence matters for its

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:40.694
interpretation.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:50.227
Before asking what ACE2 does, say which ACE2, in which

00:01:50.227 --> 00:01:52.493
compartment, and what was actually measured.
